Package: kulan-welcome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), flatpak
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings (= @VERSION@), gufw, deja-dup
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ welcome tour
 Shown once at first login: pick light or dark mode and an accent color,
 install popular apps from Flathub in one go (only those that run on this
 computer are offered), and see which security protections are on.
